    "evidence_refs": ["258d30196f80533ce1b196583ccd32517173c26ac19e37aea6231cbcab7cd212"],
    "rationale": "Audited seed-42 development mean HR@10 was 0.5865 for the +0.05 candidate, 0.59975 for the zero-injection incumbent, and 0.594 for the -0.05 control. The candidate trailed both comparators and was ineligible for confirmation. It improved over both on Industrial_and_Scientific, but lost to both on Movies_and_TV, Electronics, and CDs_and_Vinyl. Source admission, completed frozen-protocol training, and synthetic checks support the recorded implementation and execution; they do not establish a causal mechanism or held-out benefit.",
    "selection": "discard",
    "unresolved_explanations": [
      "A sign change may affect optimization or LayerNorm statistics without adding useful historical information; the existing post-normalization context blend may account for any useful history signal.",
      "Only seed 42 was evaluated. Initialization, checkpoint selection, and category heterogeneity remain competing explanations for the mixed category effects.",
      "The supplied checks do not establish the proposal's exact fixed-state CPU prefix calculation, equal-and-opposite injection at that calculation, or forward and score_candidates identities after an update. Synthetic causality and sequence probes have finite coverage.",
      "No candidate history-length readout, independent replication, or confirmation result is supplied. A discriminating follow-up would verify the fixed-state calculation and scoring path, then compare zero, positive, negative, and history-shuffled injections across independent seeds under the same frozen evaluation protocol, with the existing post-normalization blend separately ablated."
    ]
  },
  "knowledge": {
    "patch_json": "{\"base_version\":195,\"nodes\":[{\"id\":\"r16-analysis-interventions\",\"type\":\"Claim\",\"attrs\":{\"task_id\":\"amazon-research-6c9b8eab627579db\",\"protocol_hash\":\"54fbd25c87110ea1b813f57c205b1725ceb0fb77b1e61ed9a331e3fe90dc6d31\",\"origin\":\"agent_hypothesis\",\"scope\":\"amazon-research-6c9b8eab627579db\",\"status\":\"provisional\",\"evidence_refs\":[\"amazon-research-6c9b8eab627579db-258d30196f80533c-proposal\",\"amazon-research-6c9b8eab627579db-258d30196f80533c-mechanism-0db1f76c7a131282\",\"contract-model-cd0a0e8bda8886062fed3c42\",\"contract-model-b86286feb7033b611b07e690\"],\"claim\":\"The audited comparison uses +0.05 pre-normalization preceding-state injection in the candidate, zero injection in the incumbent, and -0.05 in the generated control. The sign contrast changes the intended computation, but ranking differences alone do not isolate a historical-information mechanism.\"}},{\"id\":\"r16-analysis-outcome\",\"type\":\"Claim\",\"attrs\":{\"task_id\":\"amazon-research-6c9b8eab627579db\",\"protocol_hash\":\"54fbd25c87110ea1b813f57c205b1725ceb0fb77b1e61ed9a331e3fe90dc6d31\",\"origin\":\"agent_hypothesis\",\"scope\":\"amazon-research-6c9b8eab627579db\",\"status\":\"provisional\",\"evidence_refs\":[\"amazon-research-6c9b8eab627579db-258d30196f80533c-development\",\"amazon-research-6c9b8eab627579db-258d30196f80533c-slice-04f380acbf2b\",\"amazon-research-6c9b8eab627579db-258d30196f80533c-slice-2d62719f6323\",\"amazon-research-6c9b8eab627579db-258d30196f80533c-slice-7eca97b71893\",\"amazon-research-6c9b8eab627579db-258d30196f80533c-slice-9a2a207b3cf3\"],\"claim\":\"Seed-42 development mean HR@10: candidate 0.5865, incumbent 0.59975, negative-injection control 0.594. Candidate minus incumbent is -0.01325; candidate minus control is -0.0075; control minus incumbent is -0.00575. Candidate gains on Industrial_and_Scientific (+0.008 versus incumbent, +0.010 versus control), while the other three category contrasts are negative. Neither new arm improves the aggregate incumbent. No confirmation result is supplied.\",\"category_effects\":{\"Movies_and_TV\":{\"candidate_minus_incumbent\":-0.012,\"candidate_minus_control\":0.003},\"Industrial_and_Scientific\":{\"candidate_minus_incumbent\":0.008,\"candidate_minus_control\":0.01},\"Electronics\":{\"candidate_minus_incumbent\":-0.018,\"candidate_minus_control\":-0.017},\"CDs_and_Vinyl\":{\"candidate_minus_incumbent\":-0.031,\"candidate_minus_control\":-0.026}}}},{\"id\":\"r16-analysis-alternatives\",\"type\":\"GapHypothesis\",\"attrs\":{\"task_id\":\"amazon-research-6c9b8eab627579db\",\"protocol_hash\":\"54fbd25c87110ea1b813f57c205b1725ceb0fb77b1e61ed9a331e3fe90dc6d31\",\"origin\":\"agent_hypothesis\",\"scope\":\"amazon-research-6c9b8eab627579db\",\"status\":\"provisional\",\"evidence_refs\":[\"amazon-research-6c9b8eab627579db-258d30196f80533c-proposal\",\"amazon-research-6c9b8eab627579db-258d30196f80533c-mechanism-0db1f76c7a131282\",\"amazon-research-6c9b8eab627579db-258d30196f80533c-development\"],\"alternative_explanations\":[\"Either sign changes optimization or LayerNorm statistics without supplying useful historical information.\",\"The existing post-normalization context blend already supplies the useful preceding-history signal.\",\"Independent initialization, validation checkpoint selection, or category heterogeneity produces the mixed seed-42 contrasts.\"],\"scientific_conclusion\":\"unknown\"}},{\"id\":\"r16-analysis-next-test\",\"type\":\"MeasurementGap\",\"attrs\":{\"task_id\":\"amazon-research-6c9b8eab627579db\",\"protocol_hash\":\"54fbd25c87110ea1b813f57c205b1725ceb0fb77b1e61ed9a331e3fe90dc6d31\",\"origin\":\"agent_hypothesis\",\"scope\":\"amazon-research-6c9b8eab627579db\",\"status\":\"provisional\",\"evidence_refs\":[\"amazon-research-6c9b8eab627579db-258d30196f80533c-proposal\",\"amazon-research-6c9b8eab627579db-258d30196f80533c-development\",\"amazon-research-6c9b8eab627579db-258d30196f80533c-mechanism-0db1f76c7a131282\"],\"gap\":\"Exact fixed-state prefix and after-update scoring identities, candidate history-length effects, independent-seed replication, and confirmation are not supplied.\",\"next_discriminating_experiment\":\"First verify explicit strictly preceding masked means, opposite-sign injections, zero-predecessor behavior, and forward/scoring identities on fixed CPU states after an update. Then use independently initialized seeds and the same frozen evaluation protocol to compare zero, +0.05, -0.05, and history-shuffled pre-normalization injections, with a separate ablation of the existing post-normalization blend. Report all category and history-length slices with counts; reserve any held-out confirmation for host selection.\"}}],\"edges\":[]}",
    "rationale": "The append-only patch records the implemented arms, aggregate and category-level negative and mixed outcomes, competing explanations, and the next test. Its claims remain provisional and cite only supplied graph evidence."
